# Netlify Redirect Rules for Infamous Freight

# Redirect all traffic to main domain
/* https://www.infamousfreight.com/:splat 301!

# Redirect platform subdomains
https://api.infamousfreight.com/* https://www.infamousfreight.com/ 301!
https://app.infamousfreight.com/* https://www.infamousfreight.com/ 301!
https://admin.infamousfreight.com/* https://www.infamousfreight.com/ 301!
https://dispatch.infamousfreight.com/* https://www.infamousfreight.com/ 301!
https://driver.infamousfreight.com/* https://www.infamousfreight.com/ 301!
https://broker.infamousfreight.com/* https://www.infamousfreight.com/ 301!
https://carrier.infamousfreight.com/* https://www.infamousfreight.com/ 301!

# Redirect www to non-www (if needed)
https://infamousfreight.com/* https://www.infamousfreight.com/:splat 301!

# Redirect old domain paths
/old-page /new-page 301!
/legacy/* /new-path/:splat 301!

# SPA fallback - serve index.html for all routes
/*    /index.html   200
